{"id":"c8fb767de006c9ca","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FProof.md","title":"FProof","display":"FProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FProof","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","g","z1393","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>z1393</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶证明。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>z1393</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FProof E F R f r g z1393 a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FSig E F R f r)\n  (and\n    (@ FForms E F R f r g)\n    (and\n      (@ FFm E F R f r a)\n      (exists z1378\n        (exists z1394\n          (exists z1395\n            (and\n              (@ Seq z1393 z1378)\n              (and\n                (@ Last z1393 z1394)\n                (and\n                  (@ Pair a z1395 z1394)\n                  (forall z1374\n                    (implies\n                      (in z1374 z1378)\n                      (exists z1375 (and (@ App z1393 z1374 z1375) (@ FProofRow E F R f r g z1393 z1374 z1375))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15560da670442c2e\" href=\"?note=15560da670442c2e\" title=\"ZFC_FForms\">FForms</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8513aea4cdfb45f5\" href=\"?note=8513aea4cdfb45f5\" title=\"ZFC_FProofRow\">FProofRow</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"50085369706c1ec8\" href=\"?note=50085369706c1ec8\" title=\"ZFC_FSig\">FSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FProof E F R f r g z1393 a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FForms|FForms]]；[[ZFC_FProofRow|FProofRow]]；[[ZFC_FSig|FSig]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFm","status":"resolved","id":"7d109a270c3f3d46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFm|